abstract: >
  An independent reproduction and methodological audit of the QuCNet
  quantum-inspired convolutional neural network for thyroid nodule
  classification using the Digital Database of Thyroid Ultrasound Images.
  The repository documents dataset verification, XML parsing, quantum-inspired
  feature reconstruction, classical comparisons, annotation auditing,
  case-ID-separated splitting (without verified patient identity), lesion ROI preparation, and final
  ROI-level and case-level evaluation.

